# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# This site uses HASH routing (#/, #/about), so every real request path is the
# site root and is served by index.html automatically. We therefore do NOT need
# a catch-all rewrite to /index.html — and that rule triggers Cloudflare's
# "infinite loop" validation error (requesting /index.html re-matches /* while
# its .html-stripping logic loops). Intentionally left with no rewrite rules.
